{"metadata":{"name":"Sunan Ibn Majah","section":{"31":{"eng-name":"Chapters on Medicine","ara-name":"كتاب الطب"}},"section_detail":{"31":{"hadithnumber_first":3436,"hadithnumber_last":3549,"arabicnumber_first":3436,"arabicnumber_last":3549}}},"hadiths":[{"hadithnumber":3469,"arabicnumber":3469,"text":"Rapporté par Abu Hurairah : On a parlé de la fièvre en présence du Messager d’Allah (ﷺ), et un homme l’a maudite. Le Prophète (ﷺ) a dit : « Ne la maudissez pas, car elle efface les péchés comme le feu enlève les impuretés du fer. »","grades":[{"name":"Al-Albani","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Muhammad Fouad Abd al-Baqi","grade":"Sahih"},{"name":"Shuaib Al Arnaut","grade":"Sahih Lighairihi"},{"name":"Zubair Ali Zai","grade":"Sahih"}],"reference":{"book":31,"hadith":34},"chapter":{"id":18,"ara-name":"باب الْحُمَّى","eng-name":"Fever","isFirstHadith":true}}]}